WEBVTT

00:17:26.913 --> 00:17:30.329
that's the standard order from one of
their regulars, Mike Buckin Burger.

00:17:30.954 --> 00:17:32.204
If I happen to be running late

00:17:32.204 --> 00:17:35.871
and there's more than like one person
waiting and I realize I don't have time,

00:17:35.913 --> 00:17:38.496
it kind of just destroys the morning.

00:17:38.954 --> 00:17:43.371
It goes beyond them just knowing your
order and having it ready for you.

00:17:44.038 --> 00:17:47.288
So as soon as you see them,
it's a huge smile.

00:17:47.413 --> 00:17:49.871
It was my favorite part about going
to the New York office.

00:17:50.496 --> 00:17:51.871
No offense to my colleagues.

00:17:52.204 --> 00:17:53.746
Mike works at Morgan Stanley.

00:17:54.329 --> 00:17:57.996
When he did a stint in Hong Kong, Edith
and Angelo would check in on him.

00:17:58.204 --> 00:18:00.996
I always describe them. They're the
parents of the block and they,